    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Woven Rattan Organizer Tray | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Woven Rattan Organizer Tray by wocpvm, selected by KASODI for its natural woven texture, warm tone and versatile everyday organization."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/home-organization">Home Organization</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Woven Rattan Organizer Tray</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/home-organization/wocpvm-woven-rattan-organizer-tray.png"
            alt="Woven rattan organizer tray by wocpvm styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · HOME ORGANIZATION
          </p>

          <h1>
            Woven Rattan Organizer Tray
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            wocpvm
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A compact woven tray that turns everyday organization into part of
            the room. Its warm natural tone and tactile texture make it an easy
            place to gather perfume, cosmetics, jewellery and other small
            essentials while bringing a softer, more decorative character to
            everyday storage.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Wicker</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Size</span>
              <strong>21 × 21 × 4 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Weight</span>
              <strong>Approx. 140 g</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Natural light brown</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Shape</span>
              <strong>Square</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Finish</span>
              <strong>Woven · Matte</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4yvrkcY"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Natural storage pieces work especially well when they are beautiful
            enough to remain on display. We like this tray for its warm woven
            texture and simple square silhouette — a combination that brings
            softness to bathroom counters, bedside tables and consoles while
            keeping smaller objects neatly contained.
          </p>

          <p>
            At 21 centimetres square, it is compact enough for smaller surfaces
            but still gives perfume bottles, jewellery, cosmetics and other
            everyday essentials their own defined place. The natural colour
            also pairs easily with stone, warm wood, linen, ceramics and
            amber glass.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Gentle care for woven texture</h2>

        <p>
          Wipe clean with a soft damp cloth when needed and allow the tray to
          dry naturally. Avoid soaking or placing it in the dishwasher to help
          preserve the woven structure and matte finish.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Amber Glass</h3>
            <p>
              Amber bottles and small apothecary jars deepen the warm natural
              tones of the woven tray.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Stone</h3>
            <p>
              Travertine, limestone and softly textured ceramics create a quiet
              contrast with the organic woven surface.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Soft Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Relaxed ivory or oatmeal linen adds another tactile layer while
              keeping the palette calm and natural.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>HOME ORGANIZATION</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/home-organization/textured-oval-organizer-tray"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-organization/blissilk-textured-oval-organizer-tray.png"
                alt="Textured Oval Organizer Tray"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Textured Oval Organizer Tray</h3>
              <p>Blissilk</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/amber-glass-apothecary-jars"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/kuishi-amber-glass-apothecary-jars.png"
                alt="Amber Glass Apothecary Jars"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM</span>
              <h3>Amber Glass Apothecary Jars</h3>
              <p>Kuishi</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/candles-fragrance/walnut-candle-holder-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/candles-fragrance/sabaily-walnut-candle-holder-set.png"
                alt="Walnut Candle Holder Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>CANDLE HOLDERS</span>
              <h3>Walnut Candle Holder Set</h3>
              <p>Sabai'ly</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          WOCPVM · WOVEN RATTAN TRAY
        </p>

        <h2>
          Natural texture for beautifully ordered spaces.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4yvrkcY"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>